{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01435",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 7.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.0,
      "end_seconds": 11.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.59,
      "end_seconds": 21.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "It's red, cracked skin on my hands. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.64,
      "end_seconds": 26.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.52,
      "end_seconds": 33.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Let me think, you know, for about a month, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.23,
      "end_seconds": 44.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.18,
      "end_seconds": 58.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.39,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Gloves and washing hands definitely sets it off. I get some relief from moisturiser."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.58,
      "end_seconds": 64.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Has there been stinging when you wash up too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.35,
      "end_seconds": 68.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Yeah, that too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.6,
      "end_seconds": 74.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Did you get new soap or cream, joint pain or rash elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "I haven't had new soap or cream, joint pain or rash elsewhere, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.55,
      "end_seconds": 86.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "And oozing, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.51,
      "end_seconds": 93.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "I mean, no, I haven't had any oozing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.81,
      "end_seconds": 96.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Alright, neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.32,
      "end_seconds": 100.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.54,
      "end_seconds": 104.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.36,
      "end_seconds": 113.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I'm allergic to wheat, I get bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.73,
      "end_seconds": 121.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.18,
      "end_seconds": 124.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.99,
      "end_seconds": 128.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Ah. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.64,
      "end_seconds": 133.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.79,
      "end_seconds": 152.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Alright, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.13,
      "end_seconds": 167.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.96,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. Moisturiser. I take it several times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.58,
      "end_seconds": 180.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.7,
      "end_seconds": 196.74,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.92,
      "end_seconds": 200.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.4,
      "end_seconds": 211.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.61,
      "end_seconds": 229.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.5, pulse 85, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pressure 113 over 73."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.74,
      "end_seconds": 232.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.09,
      "end_seconds": 237.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.7,
      "end_seconds": 241.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.62,
      "end_seconds": 244.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.1,
      "end_seconds": 265.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "The skin on both hands is red, dry and cracked in the finger creases, with no weeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.32,
      "end_seconds": 272.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.98,
      "end_seconds": 322.41,
      "duration_seconds": 31.43,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It's hard to say. Irritant hand dermatitis is one possibility and a fungal skin infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet. Let's get a patch test, for dermatitis. Use gloves for washing up and moisturise straight after you dry your hands. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.77,
      "end_seconds": 326.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.47,
      "end_seconds": 337.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Let's plan a check if it hasn't settled in two weeks. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.41,
      "end_seconds": 345.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "So, I come back if it hasn't settled in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.35,
      "end_seconds": 352.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.09,
      "end_seconds": 357.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.75,
      "end_seconds": 360.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}